Content:
@kurzgesagt 

You did a study on autoimmunity disease. Can you do one on vitiligo..? This is a new phenomenon. I believe this is due to foods in the United States.

Thank you for what you do.

I am lucky to be diagnosed with Crohn's 12 years ago... Knowledge about these diseases have massively improved.
Only had to struggle to find the right medication, but have now been good for at least 6 years with "Entyvio".

@kurzgesagt I would be interested in seeing how medication like Entyvio counteracts your natural immune responses ;)
